<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:37,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Naruto!</font>

32
00:01:38,410 --> 00:01:39,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't wait.</font>

33
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:42,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you not to be acting
on your own.</font>

34
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you're saying
to leave Sumaru be?!</font>

35
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru just now seemed
quite upset...</font>

36
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's definitely intending to
get revenge on Akahoshi.</font>

37
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that he's been tarred with
the reputation of Rogue Ninja,</font>

38
00:01:55,010 --> 00:01:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he'll have no place to go
throughout his life</font>

39
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if he raises a hand against
the village leader.</font>

40
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:02,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokuto?</font>

41
00:02:35,090 --> 00:02:36,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother!</font>

42
00:02:42,050 --> 00:02:43,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally...</font>

43
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally got to meet you...</font>

44
00:02:50,810 --> 00:02:51,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother.</font>

45
00:02:56,030 --> 00:03:01,070
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="28">The Star Shines Brighter</font></font>

46
00:03:13,380 --> 00:03:14,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?</font>

47
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be acting on
your own anymore.</font>

48
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, something's strange.</font>

49
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:23,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This number of Ninja
is indeed something serious.</font>

50
00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they've mobilized
all of the village Ninja.</font>

51
00:03:26,970 --> 00:03:29,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, we should see
how things go for a little while.</font>

52
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

53
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:46,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru's inside the training room...</font>

54
00:03:46,780 --> 00:03:48,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what about Sumaru's mom?</font>

55
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

56
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru...</font>

57
00:03:56,590 --> 00:03:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do we really have to do away
with him?</font>

58
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:01,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's still a kid.
Wouldn't it be okay to let things slide?</font>

59
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this moment,
he's a dangerous element.</font>

60
00:04:04,970 --> 00:04:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good would come
of letting him live.</font>

61
00:04:07,310 --> 00:04:11,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Sumaru's been
the most effective Genin in the village.</font>

62
00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have more than
enough materials...</font>

63
00:04:14,730 --> 00:04:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can just train more...</font>

64
00:04:16,770 --> 00:04:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Materials...?!</font>

65
00:04:17,860 --> 00:04:20,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't stand for it anymore!
Leave it to me!</font>

66
00:04:21,110 --> 00:04:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Forget about it.
— Let go of me!</font>

67
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to kick
that Akahoshi jerk's butt.</font>

68
00:04:24,950 --> 00:04:26,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a Star Village issue.</font>

69
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Village issues have to be resolved
by those in the village.</font>

70
00:04:30,410 --> 00:04:32,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't there something
we can do for him?</font>

71
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:33,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

72
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:37,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's charge on in
and box Akahoshi's ears...</font>

73
00:04:37,130 --> 00:04:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying?</font>

74
00:04:38,590 --> 00:04:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That'd be the same as Naruto!</font>

75
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying we must
remain idle spectators</font>

76
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even when things have gone this far?!</font>

77
00:04:44,180 --> 00:04:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

78
00:04:45,050 --> 00:04:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as there's no commission
from the village to kick Akahoshi's butt,</font>

79
00:04:49,060 --> 00:04:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's nothing we can do.</font>

80
00:04:52,980 --> 00:04:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Archer unit! Forward!</font>

81
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:04,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire!</font>

82
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:12,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until now, I felt resentment towards you,
Mother, for leaving me behind.</font>

83
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:20,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... I understand clearly now.</font>

84
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:24,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand why you
had to do that.</font>

85
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:29,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi... I will never forgive him!</font>

86
00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru...</font>

87
00:05:55,620 --> 00:05:58,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a pitiful mother and son, eh?!</font>

88
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:01,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you talking about...?</font>

89
00:06:01,590 --> 00:06:06,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I buried them both together...
There is no greater happiness.</font>

90
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Incredible Chakra!</font>

91
00:06:28,450 --> 00:06:29,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

92
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:31,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This jerk's an enemy...
He suddenly attacked.</font>

93
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're Leaf Shinobi, right?</font>

94
00:06:41,580 --> 00:06:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can tell even if you give me
the runaround...</font>

95
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:47,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The people from other lands
are all after the star.</font>

96
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:49,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you have that power,</font>

97
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:52,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can stand above
all of the Hidden Villages.</font>

98
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is your awesome Chakra
also the power of the star?</font>

99
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they had that star,</font>

100
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would everyone have
the same Chakra as you?</font>

101
00:07:00,650 --> 00:07:03,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! The more tremendous the power,</font>

102
00:07:03,690 --> 00:07:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the more hard work is required
to control it!</font>

103
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:08,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll work hard, work hard, work hard!</font>

104
00:07:08,990 --> 00:07:10,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll become the Hoshikage!</font>

105
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! I look forward to working
with you at that time!</font>

106
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm also going to become
the Hokage someday!</font>

107
00:07:19,370 --> 00:07:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a strange guy.</font>

108
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:22,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

109
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That red star sure is pretty...</font>

110
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhiboshi...</font>

111
00:07:30,050 --> 00:07:32,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It watches over me all the time...</font>

112
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you still gonna say
I should bear it after all this?</font>

113
00:07:47,150 --> 00:07:48,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru!</font>

114
00:07:58,370 --> 00:07:59,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru...</font>

115
00:08:03,620 --> 00:08:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, everyone.</font>

116
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:08,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you continue the star training,
you'll all die.</font>

117
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:14,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru's mother is the one
who took away the star.</font>

118
00:08:14,930 --> 00:08:19,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She did that in order to
protect everyone's lives!</font>

119
00:08:19,390 --> 00:08:20,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Akahoshi?</font>

120
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:23,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it true that we'll die?</font>

121
00:08:26,810 --> 00:08:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to believe
such nonsense?!</font>

122
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Being unable to withstand
the star training</font>

123
00:08:33,530 --> 00:08:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is because the heart that loves
the village is weak!</font>

124
00:08:39,830 --> 00:08:43,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who really love the village
can become true Shinobi</font>

125
00:08:43,830 --> 00:08:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and can also surpass the Hidden Villages
of the Five Great Nations!</font>

126
00:08:49,090 --> 00:08:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokuto or Lord Akahoshi...
Who's telling the truth?</font>

127
00:09:03,140 --> 00:09:04,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura?!</font>

128
00:09:04,350 --> 00:09:06,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that condition...!
It's reckless!</font>

129
00:09:08,310 --> 00:09:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, everyone!</font>

130
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's... There's something
I want everyone to see.</font>

131
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura...</font>

132
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

133
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

134
00:09:31,090 --> 00:09:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that the effect of the training?</font>

135
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How awful.</font>

136
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Akahoshi... I take pride
in the Hidden Star Village.</font>

137
00:09:42,350 --> 00:09:43,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though it was painful,</font>

138
00:09:43,850 --> 00:09:46,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I endured it and continued
the star training...</font>

139
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:51,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so, were my feelings
for the village still not enough?</font>

140
00:09:54,030 --> 00:09:54,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura!</font>

141
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think there could be lies
in that child's words... and body.</font>

142
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:04,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. So that's why
the Third Hoshikage prohibited</font>

143
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:06,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the star training for a long while.</font>

144
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We adults got carried away
with our feelings for the village</font>

145
00:10:11,590 --> 00:10:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and may have made the wrong choice...</font>

146
00:10:13,250 --> 00:10:15,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You loser!</font>

147
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:18,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you intend to mislead everyone
and crush the village?!</font>

148
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:25,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Akahoshi?!</font>

149
00:10:25,430 --> 00:10:26,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They aren't traitors.</font>

150
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:29,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're children of our village!</font>

151
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protect Hokuto and Mizura.</font>

152
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to betray the village?!</font>

153
00:10:38,610 --> 00:10:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't go along with your way
of doing things, Lord Akahoshi!</font>

154
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:45,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me, too.</font>

155
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me, too!</font>

156
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me, too.</font>

157
00:10:48,620 --> 00:10:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me, too.</font>

158
00:10:54,090 --> 00:10:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Death to those who betray the village!</font>

159
00:10:56,710 --> 00:10:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Execute them all!</font>

160
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:00,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you insane, Akahoshi?</font>

161
00:11:00,430 --> 00:11:04,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we lost all the children,
there'd be no future for the village!</font>

162
00:11:04,430 --> 00:11:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...
You're taking things too far, Akahoshi.</font>

163
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:10,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take everyone's feelings into
consideration and yield for now.</font>

164
00:11:10,560 --> 00:11:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!
What're you doing talking nice now?</font>

165
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:17,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've long since dirtied our hands.</font>

166
00:11:17,650 --> 00:11:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! What're you going to say?</font>

167
00:11:20,530 --> 00:11:22,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi, what do you mean?</font>

168
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:26,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a star in this village
that no other villages possess.</font>

169
00:11:27,450 --> 00:11:30,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just thought we didn't need
a foolish village leader</font>

170
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who wouldn't allow the star to be used.</font>

171
00:11:33,130 --> 00:11:34,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

172
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that you are the ones
who killed the Third Hoshikage?!</font>

173
00:11:37,090 --> 00:11:41,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, there were suspicious rumors
concerning the Third Hoshikage's death.</font>

174
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:45,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi, prepare yourself
and answer!</font>

175
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll pay depending on your answer.</font>

176
00:11:50,230 --> 00:11:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The three of us assassinated
the Third Hoshikage!</font>

177
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was the quickest way
to save the village.</font>

178
00:11:57,780 --> 00:11:58,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?!</font>

179
00:11:58,820 --> 00:12:00,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are the traitors!</font>

180
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right!
— Right! Right!</font>

181
00:12:01,990 --> 00:12:03,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, don't get the wrong idea.</font>

182
00:12:03,990 --> 00:12:06,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We just helped a little.</font>

183
00:12:06,450 --> 00:12:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot. That'll be an acknowledgment!</font>

184
00:12:08,990 --> 00:12:10,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi!</font>

185
00:12:10,330 --> 00:12:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will not acknowledge you
as leader of the village.</font>

186
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:15,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Justice is not with you anymore.</font>

187
00:12:15,750 --> 00:12:18,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is the children who possess the hearts
that truly care about the village.</font>

188
00:12:19,710 --> 00:12:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone! Let us rise together
with those children</font>

189
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the sake of the village.</font>

190
00:12:25,890 --> 00:12:27,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yeah!
— Yeah!</font>

191
00:12:32,020 --> 00:12:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're sorry, children.</font>

192
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:37,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were completely taken in
by Akahoshi's fast-talk.</font>

193
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As of now, we'll fight with you!</font>

194
00:12:43,990 --> 00:12:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it up, Akahoshi.</font>

195
00:12:45,450 --> 00:12:47,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've lost!</font>

196
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! I haven't lost.</font>

197
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura!</font>

198
00:12:58,170 --> 00:13:02,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokuto... Live for me...</font>

199
00:13:02,630 --> 00:13:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura!</font>

200
00:13:05,430 --> 00:13:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi, we won't let you
do as you please anymore!</font>

201
00:13:10,510 --> 00:13:12,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you do something
like go against me!</font>

202
00:13:13,100 --> 00:13:14,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you gone mad?!</font>

203
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:16,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi, you've lost!</font>

204
00:13:16,690 --> 00:13:18,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give in to justice with good grace!</font>

205
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose!</font>

206
00:13:23,490 --> 00:13:26,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The star is now... in my hands!</font>

207
00:13:26,950 --> 00:13:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The star?!</font>

208
00:13:29,530 --> 00:13:33,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will now become
the Fourth Hoshikage!</font>

209
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:13,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Power... I'm starting to brim
with power.</font>

210
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:16,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I do not need any training.</font>

211
00:14:16,830 --> 00:14:20,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could have become one with
the star if I'd done this from the start..</font>

212
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:26,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... What's this?</font>

213
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?!</font>

214
00:14:36,430 --> 00:14:37,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan.</font>

215
00:14:43,610 --> 00:14:47,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Massive Chakra from the star has
poured into his Chakra Network</font>

216
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and is causing it to go out of control.</font>

217
00:15:25,730 --> 00:15:26,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokuto!</font>

218
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't take it anymore!
Neji! Hey, Neji!</font>

219
00:15:53,220 --> 00:15:55,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't... Naruto...</font>

220
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:59,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what you say,
I'll kick that Akahoshi jerk's butt!</font>

221
00:16:01,850 --> 00:16:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk. I won't be responsible.</font>

222
00:16:05,230 --> 00:16:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. Just say that I butt in on my own.</font>

223
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Akahoshi.</font>

224
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi!</font>

225
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

226
00:16:44,650 --> 00:16:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

227
00:16:51,690 --> 00:16:53,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk.</font>

228
00:17:06,790 --> 00:17:07,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you...</font>

229
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:10,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhiboshi...</font>

230
00:17:10,710 --> 00:17:11,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you so red?</font>

231
00:17:12,010 --> 00:17:14,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru's mom.</font>

232
00:17:14,420 --> 00:17:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because...</font>

233
00:17:15,130 --> 00:17:16,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's her voice.</font>

234
00:17:16,220 --> 00:17:19,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had a sad dream last night</font>

235
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:25,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My eyes are red, from the tears I shed</font>

236
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Swollen as I cried</font>

237
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:37,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhiboshi, why've you lost your way?</font>

238
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm searching for a child...</font>

239
00:17:39,370 --> 00:17:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru...</font>

240
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who has gone afar</font>

241
00:17:43,620 --> 00:17:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can't be found, though I search all day</font>

242
00:17:49,630 --> 00:17:50,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My sad dreams come once more...</font>

243
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Ninja Art: Kujaku...</font>

244
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to be controlled even after death.
At that time, Natsuhi did...</font>

245
00:17:57,470 --> 00:17:59,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you, Natsuhi!</font>

246
00:17:59,050 --> 00:18:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You protect Sumaru even after you die?!</font>

247
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:20,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru's mom.</font>

248
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying you'll lend me support?!</font>

249
00:18:24,410 --> 00:18:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right. Got it!</font>

250
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

251
00:18:45,390 --> 00:18:46,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

252
00:18:49,770 --> 00:18:51,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

253
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite having been assigned
a mission to protect the star,</font>

254
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to think you'd smash
the all-important star...</font>

255
00:19:08,460 --> 00:19:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You didn't just fail to complete
the mission!</font>

256
00:19:10,870 --> 00:19:12,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The compensation fee
will be massive.</font>

257
00:19:13,250 --> 00:19:17,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Grandma, I had no other choice!</font>

258
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:21,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my fault as the leader
for not being able to stop him.</font>

259
00:19:21,930 --> 00:19:23,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm responsible as well!</font>

260
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:25,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. I also...</font>

261
00:19:25,510 --> 00:19:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that'd be a matter
under normal circumstances.</font>

262
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:31,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We haven't received complaints
from the Star Village</font>

263
00:19:31,730 --> 00:19:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with regard to the incident of
the star being smashed.</font>

264
00:19:35,230 --> 00:19:37,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In fact, the culprit of this incident</font>

265
00:19:38,030 --> 00:19:41,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was the client Akahoshi,
the deputy Hoshikage.</font>

266
00:19:41,740 --> 00:19:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the mission itself is forgotten!</font>

267
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it,
what happened to him?</font>

268
00:19:46,950 --> 00:19:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems the three,</font>

269
00:19:48,410 --> 00:19:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the main culprit Akahoshi and
accomplices Yotaka and Shisou,</font>

270
00:19:51,750 --> 00:19:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will be punished severely
by Hidden Star Village!</font>

271
00:19:55,540 --> 00:19:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's good! Now the Star Village
will be peaceful.</font>

272
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:03,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come in.</font>

273
00:20:04,140 --> 00:20:08,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, all the Genin from
the Star Village have been examined.</font>

274
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...?</font>

275
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they all receive proper treatment,
they will return to good health.</font>

276
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:14,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what about Mizura?</font>

277
00:20:15,020 --> 00:20:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. That boy will also be fine.</font>

278
00:20:17,270 --> 00:20:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! So where's everyone?</font>

279
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've completed their examinations
and are heading for their quarters.</font>

280
00:20:23,820 --> 00:20:26,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto! The lecture isn't...</font>

281
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He never changes.</font>

282
00:20:35,330 --> 00:20:36,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, guys.</font>

283
00:20:37,590 --> 00:20:40,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's great! Get better, Mizura.</font>

284
00:20:40,420 --> 00:20:41,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

285
00:20:41,630 --> 00:20:43,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to you.</font>

286
00:20:43,930 --> 00:20:44,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, what?!</font>

287
00:20:45,050 --> 00:20:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll become Hoshikage before you!</font>

288
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:49,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even without the power of the star,</font>

289
00:20:49,890 --> 00:20:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make the Village Hidden in the Stars
into a most powerful Ninja village!</font>

290
00:20:54,270 --> 00:20:55,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?</font>

291
00:20:56,150 --> 00:20:59,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way will I lose!
I'll become Hokage before you!</font>

292
00:20:59,730 --> 00:21:01,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up. I'll be first.</font>

293
00:21:01,360 --> 00:21:03,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be first!</font>

